truction-tuned llm and latent diffusion model.\n\narXiv preprint arXiv:2304.13731.\n\nCited by: §I,\n§II-A.\n\n- [9]\nZ. Du, C. Gao, Y. Wang, F. Yu, T. Zhao, H. Wang, X. Lv, H. Wang, C. Ni, X. Shi, et al. (2025)\n\nCosyvoice 3: towards in-the-wild speech generation via scaling-up and post-training.\n\narXiv preprint arXiv:2505.17589.\n\nCited by: §II-B,\nTABLE III.\n\n- [10]\nZ. Du, Y. Wang, Q. Chen, X. Shi, X. Lv, T. Zhao, Z. Gao, Y. Yang, C. Gao, H. Wang, et al. (2024)\n\nCosyvoice 2: scalable streaming speech synthesis with large language models.\n\narXiv preprint arXiv:2412.10117.\n\nCited by: §II-B,\nTABLE III.\n\n- [11]\nP. Esser, S. Kulal, A. Blattmann, R. Entezari, J. Müller, H. Saini, Y. Levi, D. Lorenz, A. Sauer, F. Boesel, et al. (2024)\n\nScaling rectified flow transformers for high-resolution image synthesis.\n\nIn Forty-first international conference on machine learning,\n\nCited by: §III-B.\n\n- [12]\nZ. Evans, J. D. Parker, C. Carr, Z. Zukowski, J. Taylor, and J. Pons (2025)\n\nStable audio open.\n\nIn ICASSP 2025-2025 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP),\n\npp. 1–5.\n\nCited by: §II-A,\nTABLE II.\n\n- [13]\nZ. Evans, J. D. Parker, M. Rice, C. Carr, Z. Zukowski, J. Taylor, and J. Pons (2026)\n\nStable audio 3.\n\narXiv preprint arXiv:2605.17991.\n\nCited by: TABLE II.\n\n- [14]\nJ. F. Gemmeke, D. P. Ellis, D. Freedman, A. Jansen, W. Lawrence, R. C. Moore, M. Plakal, and M. Ritter (2017)\n\nAudio set: an ontology and human-labeled dataset for audio events.\n\nIn 2017 IEEE international conference on acoustics, speech and signal processing (ICASSP),\n\npp. 776–780.\n\nCited by: 1st item.\n\n- [15]\nD. Ghosal, N. Majumder, A. Mehrish, and S. Poria (2023)\n\nText-to-audio generation using instruction tuned llm and latent diffusion model.\n\narXiv preprint arXiv:2304.13731.\n\nCited by: TABLE II.\n\n- [16]\nJ. Hai, Y. Xu, H. Zhang, C. Li, H. Wang, M. Elhilali, and D. Yu (2024)\n\nEzaudio: enhancing text-to-aud